<title>GERMANY: Lower H1 profits at RWE-DEA.</title>
<headline>Lower H1 profits at RWE-DEA.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     133.2   vs 145.1</p>
<p>Group sales</p>
<p>    (including petroleum sales)	    13,600  vs 11,700</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German oil company is RWE-DEA Mineraloel AG, the petroleum and chemical unit of diversified energy group RWE AG. The company's business year runs to end-June 19.</p>
</text>
